# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# The cluster is Talos/Linux and every manifest is consumed by kustomize there.
# On Windows, core.autocrlf=true rewrites working-tree files to CRLF, which
# makes `flux diff` report phantom drift on every touched file (the rendered
# ConfigMap differs from the committed blob by line endings only).
#
# Pinning eol=lf keeps the working tree and the committed blob byte-identical
# across platforms, so `flux diff` shows real drift only.
* text=auto eol=lf

# These are generated/encrypted by sops and must stay byte-exact.
*.yaml text eol=lf
